      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "指数的和等于二项式的幂指数$n$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "3°. 与展开式的两端等距的二项式系数彼此相等（因为",
        "$C_n^m=C_n^{n-m}$）."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "4°. 二项式系数开始增大，然后减小. 如果二项式的幂",
        "指数是偶数，那么，位于展开式的中间一项的二项式系数最",
        "大. 如果二项式的幂指数是奇数，那么，位于展开式的中间的",
        "两项的二项式系数彼此相等而且最大."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "5°. 为了写出等式（1）的通项，把二项式幂的展开式中的",
        "第$k+1$项当作第$k$项，较为方便，并记作$T_k$. 于是有",
        "$T_k=C_n^ka^{n-k}b^k$，$k=0,1,\\cdots,n$.$\\qquad(2)$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例如，第一项$T_0=C_n^0a^nb^0$，第二项$T_1=C_n^1a^{n-1}b^1$，第三",
        "项$T_2=C_n^2a^{n-2}b^2$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例2. 求$(z^{\\frac12}+z^{\\frac23})^{12}$的展开式的第四项.",
        "根据公式（2），展开式的第四项等于",
        "$T_4=C_{12}^4(z^{\\frac12})^8(z^{\\frac23})^4=495z^{\\frac{20}3}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例3. 求$(z+z^{-2})^{12}$的展开式中不包含$z$的项，即$z$的幂",
        "指数等于零的项.",
        "根据公式（2），得",
        "$T_k=C_{12}^kz^{12-k}(z^{-2})^k=C_{12}^kz^{12-3k}$.",
        "根据题的条件，$12-3k=0$，得$k=4$. 因此，展开式的第",
        "四项$z$的幂指数等于零."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例4.* $(1+0.01)^{1000}$的展开式中，第几项最大？",
        "$\\frac{T_{k+1}}{T_k}=\\frac{C_{1000}^{k+1}\\times0.01^{k+1}}{C_{1000}^k\\times0.01^k}=\\frac{0.01\\times k!(1000-k)!}{(k+1)!(1000-k-1)!}$"
      ]
    },
